1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,389
Gelombang tsunami bisa

2
00:00:01,409 --> 00:00:03,324
melintasi samudra dengan

3
00:00:03,344 --> 00:00:04,763
kecepatan pesawat,

4
00:00:04,783 --> 00:00:06,311
tetapi bagaimana gelombang itu

5
00:00:06,331 --> 00:00:07,013
terbentuk?

6
00:00:07,033 --> 00:00:08,151
Semuanya berawal di dasar

7
00:00:08,171 --> 00:00:08,739
laut.

8
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:09,792
Di zona subduksi,

9
00:00:09,812 --> 00:00:11,200
satu lempeng tektonik menyusup

10
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,315
ke bawah lempeng lain.

11
00:00:12,335 --> 00:00:13,306
Tegangan menumpuk,

12
00:00:13,326 --> 00:00:14,549
sampai patahan itu lepas.

13
00:00:14,569 --> 00:00:16,665
Gempa besar menggeser dasar

14
00:00:16,685 --> 00:00:18,056
laut secara vertikal.

15
00:00:18,076 --> 00:00:19,774
Seluruh kolom air di atasnya

16
00:00:19,794 --> 00:00:21,002
ikut terdorong.

17
00:00:21,022 --> 00:00:22,055
Air bergerak mencari

18
00:00:22,075 --> 00:00:24,404
keseimbangan, dan gelombang

19
00:00:24,424 --> 00:00:25,647
menyebar ke segala arah.

20
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:27,854
Ini beda dengan ombak biasa.

21
00:00:27,874 --> 00:00:29,031
Ombak angin hanya mengguncang

22
00:00:29,051 --> 00:00:30,083
permukaan.

23
00:00:30,103 --> 00:00:31,152
Tsunami menggerakkan seluruh

24
00:00:31,172 --> 00:00:32,072
kedalaman laut,

25
00:00:32,092 --> 00:00:33,125
dengan jarak antarpuncak yang

26
00:00:33,145 --> 00:00:34,680
bisa ratusan kilometer.

27
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,306
Kecepatannya ditentukan

28
00:00:36,326 --> 00:00:37,510
kedalaman.

29
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:40,374
Di laut sedalam 4.600 meter,

30
00:00:40,394 --> 00:00:43,472
lajunya sekitar 765 kilometer

31
00:00:43,492 --> 00:00:44,259
per jam.

32
00:00:44,279 --> 00:00:45,807
Tapi tingginya jarang lebih

33
00:00:45,827 --> 00:00:46,869
dari satu meter.

34
00:00:46,889 --> 00:00:48,138
Kapal di tengah laut biasanya

35
00:00:48,158 --> 00:00:49,180
tidak merasakannya.

36
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,465
Mendekati pantai,

37
00:00:50,485 --> 00:00:52,168
laut makin dangkal.

38
00:00:52,188 --> 00:00:53,793
Gelombang melambat sampai 30

39
00:00:53,813 --> 00:00:55,496
hingga 50 kilometer per jam,

40
00:00:55,516 --> 00:00:56,487
jaraknya memendek,

41
00:00:56,507 --> 00:00:57,754
dan airnya meninggi.

42
00:00:57,774 --> 00:00:59,286
Inilah efek pendangkalan,

43
00:00:59,306 --> 00:01:00,368
atau shoaling.

44
00:01:00,388 --> 00:01:00,848
Di darat,

45
00:01:00,868 --> 00:01:01,993
air bisa datang seperti banjir

46
00:01:02,013 --> 00:01:02,891
yang naik cepat,

47
00:01:02,911 --> 00:01:04,249
atau dinding air.

48
00:01:04,269 --> 00:01:05,472
Di pantai utara Sumatra tahun

49
00:01:05,492 --> 00:01:06,849
2004, tingginya mencapai

50
00:01:06,869 --> 00:01:08,082
sekitar 50 meter.

51
00:01:08,102 --> 00:01:09,878
Dan tsunami datang berseri.

52
00:01:09,898 --> 00:01:11,287
Gelombang pertama belum tentu

53
00:01:11,307 --> 00:01:12,169
yang terbesar.

54
00:01:12,189 --> 00:01:13,439
Kalau gempa kuat terasa di

55
00:01:13,459 --> 00:01:14,956
pantai, atau laut tiba-tiba

56
00:01:14,976 --> 00:01:16,829
surut, segera lari ke tempat

57
00:01:16,849 --> 00:01:17,605
tinggi.

